 lines+=['','## Initialization-strength coupling','', 'The separate seven-strength screen sealed all256×7 predictions before offline scoring. HC gamma0.5/0.75 improved the initialization-only whole-panel score; Vid gamma1 remained best. HC therefore actually replays40-step OPD from both changed initializations at both the original baseline optimizer and original optimizer winner, then one mean-centered four-corner lr/tau neighborhood at its adapted coarse winner. Gamma scales Source-to-consensus center/log-size before adaptation; alpha scales the adaptation residual after fitting. No additional expert evidence, Source encoding or observation position is introduced. The same7200s cumulative worker cap covers all phases. The final comparison without spatial adaptation uses the same selected E_gamma, so initialization gains are not counted as OPD gains.','']
