 lines+=['','See FAILURE_PARAMETER_LINKS.md, VISUAL_FAILURE_AUDIT_PUBLIC.json, STATE_MAPPING_AUDIT_PUBLIC.json and SELECTED_FAILURE_FOLLOWUP.md for the retained harmful cases, matched parameter changes, six visually inspected examples, nonzero state-mapping audit and actual final-case outcomes.','']
