 lines+=['','## Evidence scope','', 'These are development-selected results on repeatedly exposed parents. The reported paired bootstrap intervals describe the selected outcomes and do not adjust for the coarse/fine selection process. They do not establish independent generalization or a new independent Live-over-Fixed effect. Each direction has one fixed configuration shared by every video; all positive, negative, zero-intersection and no-update outcomes remain. If an adaptive winner is below E_Ref+Strong, that limitation is retained in SELECTION_PUBLIC.json rather than hidden. Source and Strong are verified unchanged. The selected E_gamma is independently verified against its initialization-strength screen; its improvement is separated from OPD relative to that same E_gamma.','', 'All candidates and signed parent scores are public under all_parameter_outcomes/INDEX.json, including every coarse/fine setting, controls, uncertainty, tails and parameter definitions. SELECTED_FIVE_ROW_RESULTS_PUBLIC.json contains the complete selected five-row parent outcomes. This finite search does not exhaust continuous initialization strengths, sampling scales, optimizer families or longer budgets; no conclusion of global optimality is made.','', '## Actual search cost','']
